<title>USA: Stifel investor raises stake to 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Stifel investor raises stake to 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Del Mintz, an investor from Shaker Heights, Ohio, said Tuesday he raised his stake in Stifel Financial Corp to 14 percent or 625,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Mintz said he bought 66,300 additional shares of Stifel between September 10 and September 16 at prices ranging from $7.00 to $8.00 a share.</p>
</text>
